  template:
    name: Particle Lit
    category: Particle
    description: 'A simple Lit shader, set up to work with both Billboard and Mesh (GPU Instancing enabled) Particle Systems.

      It uses the default Vertex Streams, includes texture map parameters for Base Map, Normal Map and Mask Map, supports Particle Color and Alpha from the Particle System, as well as Flipbook UVs from the Texture Sheet Animation module.

      It''s a good starting point to create a custom lit particle shader.

      

      <i>Supported Pipeline(s): HDRP & URP

      Active Target: Lit

      VFX Graph Support: disabled</i>'
    icon: {instanceID: 0}
